@message user
[Runtime interruption] The preceding execution was interrupted by a backend restart. Its execution plan and uncompleted tool calls are no longer pending. Do not replay them or carry their steps into the next request. Retain completed results as history; missing results mean unknown effects. Follow the new user request independently, and only perform old work if it explicitly asks for that work.
@endmessage
